[0.003304,"o","No existing configuration found — running first-time setup.\r\nConfiguration Location\r\nConfig file:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-_j31i1iu/config.yaml\r\nSecrets file: /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-_j31i1iu/.env\r\nData folder:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-_j31i1iu\r\n"]
[0.005995,"o","Install dir:  /home/runner/work/hermes-rust-version/hermes-rust-version/crates/hermes-cli\r\nYou can edit these files directly or use 'hermes config edit'\r\n\r\nTip: jump straight to a section with 'hermes setup model|terminal|gateway|tools|agent', or fill only missing items with --quick.\r\nPress Enter to keep it, or type a new value to change it.\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m How would you like to set up Hermes?  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mQuick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\u001b[39m\r\n  Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\r\n  Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, enter to select, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[4A\u001b[39C\u001b[?25h"]
[0.3092,"o","\u001b[?25l\u001b[39D\u001b[38;5;10m>\u001b[39m How would you like to set up Hermes? \u001b["]
[0.311626,"o","38;5;14mQuick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, mo\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;14mdel + tools (recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[3A\u001b[?25h\r\nNous Portal\r\nOne subscription, 300+ models, plus the Tool Gateway:\r\n  web search, image generation, TTS, browser automation.\r\nSign up: https://portal.nousresearch.com/manage-subscription\r\n  Nous Portal OAuth is not available in Hermes-RS yet — pick a provider below.\r\n\r\n\r\nModel & Provider\r\nChoose how to connect to your main chat model.\r\n   Guide: https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/integrations/providers\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m Select provider:  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mNous Portal (Everything your agent needs, 300+ models with bundled tool use)\u001b[39m\r\n  Fireworks AI (OpenAI-compatible direct model API)\r\n  OpenRouter (Pay-per-use API aggregator)\r\n  Mixture of Agents (named presets; aggregator acts after reference models)\r\n  NovitaAI (Cloud: Model API, Agent Sandbox, GPU Cloud)\r\n  LM Studio (Local desktop app with built-in model server)\r\nv Anthropic (Claude models via API key or Claude Code)\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, enter to select, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[8A\u001b[19C\u001b[?25h"]
